    "_tiers_note": "English display ladder, ascending (barony, march, county, duchy, principality, kingdom, empire), with the Hellenic conlang co-titles beneath in *_native. County ruler shows as the approved foreign term Archon. Native: Toparch/Toparchy barony; Phrourarch/Phrourarchia march (a garrison command); Eparch/Eparchy county; Strategos/Strategia duchy; Dynastes/Dynasteia principality; Basileus/Basileia kingdom; Autokrator/Autokratoria empire. -arch/-archy rhyme the lower native tiers; Basileus/Basileia and Autokrator/Autokratoria the high.",
