    "display_policy": "Ruler/domain titles shown in setting-gen, domain lists and vassal trees are ENGLISH (or an approved commonly-known foreign term where set in 'ruler' - here Archon for the county). The *_native conlang forms are for NPC DIALOGUE ONLY, never for structural/UI displays.",
